   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "PERSPECTIVE & MINDSET\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 97 to 112\n   1 Whose good they see\n   2 Mindset\n   3 Closed mindset to Widening mindset\n   4 How the belief shows\n   5 Blind spot\n   6 Talking themselves into it\n   7 Misreading someone\n   8 Seeing signs everywhere\n   9 suite: Closed mind\n  10 suite: The circle widens\n  11 suite: Cannot see it\n  12 suite: Slippery slope\n  13 suite: Omens\n  14 pair: When a belief is challenged hard, the mindset opens\n  15 pair: When a character starts caring about the whole world, what they want lines up with what they need\n  16 pair: When a belief turns into a big choice, the character changes\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 1 to 9\n   1 pair: When the blind spot grows, they misread people\n   2 pair: When the blind spot opens in one blow, they see it all\n   3 pair: When they strike back at a misread friend, things get worse\n   4 pair: When the excuses grow stronger, they slip back\n   5 pair: When they talk themselves into cruelty, there is no going back\n   6 pair: When they believe the signs more, dread grows\n   7 pair: When they live by the signs, their mind closes\n   8 pairs: Growing up\n   9 pairs: Talked into it"
   },
